    <textTemplates>
        <name>Review_Email_Body</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Greetings IAFC Staff,

New candidates from this sync: {!New_Candidate_Count}
Total outstanding candidates: {!Outstanding_Candidate_Count}

The nightly automated NERIS-to-Salesforce sync job found fire department records that may match existing Salesforce Accounts and need staff review.

Open the review list:
https://iafchelix.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Dashboard/01ZV1000004moY5MAI/view

You can also use the reports in the NERIS Matching Review folder in Salesforce.

How to review a possible match:
1. Open a match candidate record from the review list or report.
2. Compare the NERIS fire department record with the suggested Salesforce Account.
3. If they are the same organization, click Accept Match. This links the Salesforce Account to the NERIS fire department record and removes any remaining match candidates for that fire department.
4. If they are not the same organization, do not accept the match. Leave it for follow-up or use IAFC&apos;s normal review process.

Sync Summary:
NERIS source records read: {!$Record.Source_Record_Count__c}
NERIS departments inserted: {!$Record.Inserted_Count__c}
NERIS departments updated: {!$Record.Updated_Count__c}
Failed records: {!$Record.Failed_Count__c}

Possible failure reason:
{!$Record.Error_Summary__c}

For further details, please refer to the NERIS nightly sync job documentation.</text>
    </textTemplates>
